tmux 3.8: clip the focused top junction to its pane.

Opt in per window with: set-option -w @pane-border-clip-top on
Other windows and interior junctions retain the upstream rendering.
Applied at draw time so switching focus does not reuse the previous corner.

Upstream: https://github.com/tmux/tmux/tree/3.8
screen-redraw.c SHA256: 7ef109c63a4a38e79d0101886ca5785db29c9602fdc48bb2d83861c91840ccfc

